  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 7.6.x\n\n__Breaking Changes__:\n* Removed .NET Standard 2.0 and 2.1 support\n* Removed deprecated code\n* Moved LINQ style extensions for StringSegment to a different library.\n\n### Non Breaking Changes\n* Add StringSegment case detection extensions\n* Add StringSegment case ``CapitalizeChar`` and ``CapitalizeChars``\n* Updated StringSegment ``AsEnumerable`` method\n* Re-worked StringSegment ``Contains`` methods\n* Removed StringSegment ``IsNullOrEmpty`` extension method as redundant\n* Removed reliance on DotExtensions main package\n* Improve whitespace detection in StringSegment ``IsNullOrWhiteSpace`` extension method",
